  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">일정 성분비 법칙 예시로 샌드위치 재료 넣기 비유를 보다가 카나페 만들기를 해봤습니다.<br>&#160;<br>준비물 : 아이비(과자), 슬라이스 치즈, 슬라이스 햄, 잼<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45b2c353070799a80216b5eed2c7dbae3eb2523f_re_1776223132583\" data-origin-width=\"879\" data-origin-height=\"770\" style=\"width:74.86%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45b2c353070799a80216b5eed2c7dbae3eb2523f_re_1776223132583\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7deb76ab8500f88a86d0a291f5265c51cf9b217a_re_1776223132583\" data-origin-width=\"301\" data-origin-height=\"785\" style=\"width:25.14%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7deb76ab8500f88a86d0a291f5265c51cf9b217a_re_1776223132583\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e654e63087c37718a9bc36690d174c49a80ff6d_re_1776223132583\" data-origin-width=\"451\" data-origin-height=\"782\" style=\"width:44.31%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8e654e63087c37718a9bc36690d174c49a80ff6d_re_1776223132583\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d8e94813050fb474159d2cb9119c2c27b5b200c_re_1776223132579\" data-origin-width=\"659\" data-origin-height=\"909\" style=\"width:55.69%; margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d8e94813050fb474159d2cb9119c2c27b5b200c_re_1776223132579\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">활동지를 만들고, 직접 카나페를 만들면서 하면 좀 난리가 날 것 같아서..<br>먹을 거 가지고 장난치지 말자고 하고.. 조별 학습지를 배부한 후에</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0275131366fe50c2644ba5d389e0a9c7b5a10da_re_1776171804490?download\" data-file-name=\"까나페로 배우는 일정 성분비 법칙 조별 활동지.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"2357064\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1292%26fileid%3D16%26regdt%3D20260415121930&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa0275131366fe50c2644ba5d389e0a9c7b5a10da_re_1776171804490')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">까나페로 배우는 일정 성분비 법칙 조별 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.25MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bd60ab02d371dde1e75d6cb760cbc458ea59d5b_re_1776223132575?download\" data-file-name=\"카나페 공장 ppt.pptx\" data-file-size=\"18428714\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1292%26fileid%3D17%26regdt%3D20260415121930&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6bd60ab02d371dde1e75d6cb760cbc458ea59d5b_re_1776223132575')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">카나페 공장 ppt</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">17.57MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c76cf6652338d269435ed4b40f14f6b4d1183c5f_re_1776223132579\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c76cf6652338d269435ed4b40f14f6b4d1183c5f_re_1776223132579\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f76e930948f6805712e9860a6b40d54c6f8b4fc2_re_1776223132578\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f76e930948f6805712e9860a6b40d54c6f8b4fc2_re_1776223132578\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/190e4dd0fb3d051d9f829b314218e62f6555678b_re_1776223132577\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/190e4dd0fb3d051d9f829b314218e62f6555678b_re_1776223132577\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2afdf5c6d8822d2d5129628e315d915f6cee691d_re_1776223132577\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2afdf5c6d8822d2d5129628e315d915f6cee691d_re_1776223132577\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b960b7a2e8db9b86474125032ede5a607f90cf9_re_1776223132576\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b960b7a2e8db9b86474125032ede5a607f90cf9_re_1776223132576\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f792ca0eab116026920bc850751b50ad3e3a451d_re_1776223132576\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f792ca0eab116026920bc850751b50ad3e3a451d_re_1776223132576\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e676c591aa3a7eefdbdc45780983000ab41ba8c5_re_1776223132576\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e676c591aa3a7eefdbdc45780983000ab41ba8c5_re_1776223132576\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">여기까지는 제미나이가 만들어준 이미지를 보며 가상으로 실험하면서 풀었습니다.<br>그 다음에 아래 체크리스트를 보여준 후 조원 1명 (과학 못하는 조원)에게 랜덤으로 질문하고 2번의 기회가 있다. 꼭 맞춰야 카나페를 먹을 수 있다고 하니까... 이 4가지 질문을 열변을 토하며 서로 설명해줍니다 ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d60917165d6db4c18a563b7e85a9b5dbcc9f10f_re_1776223132575\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d60917165d6db4c18a563b7e85a9b5dbcc9f10f_re_1776223132575\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>한 조 한 조 검사하면서, 먼저 통과한 조는 뒤에 문제 의논하면서 풀어보라고 했습니다.<br>모두 다 통과하면 모두 손을 씻은 후 재료를 배부해서 먹게 했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&lt;활동 후 피드백&gt;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">+ 그릇에 1인당 아이비1통(8개 들어있음), 슬라이스 치즈 1개, 의성마늘 한입슬라이스햄 1개씩 먹을 수 있게&#160; <span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">조별 그릇 하나에 인원수대로 담아주었습니다. (비닐 덮어서 그릇은 재활용)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">그리고 </span>딸기잼은 가상실험에는 넣지 않고, 아이들이 달달한 맛을 좋아할 것 같아서 추가로 한 통 구매하여 교탁에 두고 원하는 사람만 나와서 가져가도록 했습니다. (딸기잼이 킥이라며 제일 좋아했네요.. 만들때 잼은 꼭 구매하시길 추천합니다ㅋㅋ)</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">+ 아이들이 카나페라는 음식 자체를 잘 몰라서 예시로 만든 사진을 보여주거나 어떻게 만드는 지 설명해줘야하는 반도 있었습니다;;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>&#160;&#160;여학생들은 예쁘게 만들어 먹고</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d384ad6aa41a172f251df6f0157d9a9ab6e185aa_re_1776223132575\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d384ad6aa41a172f251df6f0157d9a9ab6e185aa_re_1776223132575\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/045fd7a46a01dd3e13886eaa3a07a12443f2d859_re_1776223132575\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/045fd7a46a01dd3e13886eaa3a07a12443f2d859_re_1776223132575\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">남학생들은 한번에...ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f79336cef0c3861bd12d18f81dc8e12aff14b53_re_1776223132575\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"203\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f79336cef0c3861bd12d18f81dc8e12aff14b53_re_1776223132575\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>한 번 쉬어가는 수업으로 하려고 했는데 의외로 조원들에게 엄청 열심히 설명해주고 이해하는 과정이 있어서... 그냥 먹고 노는 수업은 아니어서 다행이었습니다 ㅠㅠ</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}